 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Three verbs, one direction",
     "texto": [
      "**あげます** = I give something to someone else. **くれます** = someone else gives it to me. **もらいます** = I receive something from someone else.",
      "The person who receives takes **に**: **ともだち に はな を あげます** (I give flowers to my friend). The giver can take **から**: **ともだち から ほん を もらいました** (I received a book from my friend)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Who the subject is",
     "texto": [
      "With **くれます** the giver is the other person, and you are the receiver: **やまだ さん が わたし に ほん を くれました**.",
      "With **あげます** and **もらいます** the usual subject is you, so there is no need to say **わたし は** if it is already clear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
